@WorkFlow_API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7040

### Cadastrar empresa

POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Empresa Testes",
  "registrationNumber": "REG-API-00122223333ee",
  "email": "empresa-api@test.local",
  "phone": "(47) 99999-9999"
}

### Tentar cadastrar empresa com nome vazio

POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": " ",
  "registrationNumber": "REG-INVALIDO-001",
  "email": "invalida@test.local"
}

### Consultar empresa pelo PublicId

GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/908a9309-07d6-4c7f-9446-3085a82a2f8e
Accept: application/json

### Consultar empresa inexistente

GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json